    "detailed_description": "Retro 2D side-scrolling shooter with pixel art. Control a penguin (Laser), a fish (Firebreath), and a human (Railgun) to achieve a high score!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* 2D side-scrolling shooter (5 stages)<br />\r\n* 8 directions and 2 buttons (A-shot, B-blow)<br />\r\n* Two types of bombs (hold B: bomb1, hold AB: bomb2)<br />\r\n* Penguins are birds, so please rise to the surface and breathe periodically.<br />\r\n* Gamepad is recommended....Turn the lever once + A to perform a hidden move.<br />\r\n* Hold A to fix the direction of fire (* can be fine-tuned with \u2192\u2192 or \u2190\u2190)<br />\r\n* Tilt the direction lever twice to dash and jump.<br />\r\n* Nostalgia. Dot pictures and retro sounds......made by an old man.<br />\r\n* This game may be a music game...the BGMs has a meaning.<br />\r\n* Don't worry. There is no story connection with the previous game &quot;Uki Uki Tengoku(Heaven)&quot;.<br />\r\n* No restrictions on distribution of gameplay videos",
    "about_the_game": "Retro 2D side-scrolling shooter with pixel art. Control a penguin (Laser), a fish (Firebreath), and a human (Railgun) to achieve a high score!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* 2D side-scrolling shooter (5 stages)<br />\r\n* 8 directions and 2 buttons (A-shot, B-blow)<br />\r\n* Two types of bombs (hold B: bomb1, hold AB: bomb2)<br />\r\n* Penguins are birds, so please rise to the surface and breathe periodically.<br />\r\n* Gamepad is recommended....Turn the lever once + A to perform a hidden move.<br />\r\n* Hold A to fix the direction of fire (* can be fine-tuned with \u2192\u2192 or \u2190\u2190)<br />\r\n* Tilt the direction lever twice to dash and jump.<br />\r\n* Nostalgia. Dot pictures and retro sounds......made by an old man.<br />\r\n* This game may be a music game...the BGMs has a meaning.<br />\r\n* Don't worry. There is no story connection with the previous game &quot;Uki Uki Tengoku(Heaven)&quot;.<br />\r\n* No restrictions on distribution of gameplay videos",
